# Dependency sources for the Dolby Vision Profile 7 FEL build — sourced by
# scripts/build-fel-deps.sh.
#
# As of 2026-07-01 the whole FEL feature is UPSTREAM: mpv master carries it
# natively (PR #17932, merged), and both deps it needs are in their own upstream
# masters. So there is no fork to track anymore — we point at the canonical
# upstream master branches. We still build these two from source only because no
# distro/release ships them yet (see the "remaining gate" note at the bottom).

# libplacebo — provides pl_frame.enhancement_layer (the FEL reconstruction).
# Upstream master is at PL_API_VER 370; the >= 7.370 gate in build-fel-deps.sh
# still holds. (Was code.videolan.org/kasper93/libplacebo dv-fel, now merged via
# MR !851 — no released tag has it yet: latest is v7.360.1.)
#
# PINNED to 41ac2980 (= v7.371.0) — the last commit before the 7.372 window
# introduced macOS MoltenVK crashes. See commit 3c3bf6e7 ("dispatch: reject
# rendering to UINT/SINT formats") which fires PL_ERR_INVALID_FORMAT on certain
# pass configurations that mpv's gpu-next renderer doesn't handle, causing
# null VkCommandBuffer -> SIGSEGV in pl_pass_create. A future commit that
# properly propagates dispatch errors (or mpv handles PL_ERR_INVALID_FORMAT)
# may unpin us, but for now 7.371.0 is the known-good baseline for macOS.
LIBPLACEBO_URL="https://code.videolan.org/videolan/libplacebo.git"
LIBPLACEBO_REF="41ac2980e1a898f41d7c2e07999f9862ee89d99f"

# ffmpeg — master registers the dovi_split BSF (libavcodec/bsf/dovi_split.c) and
# the AV_STREAM_GROUP_PARAMS_DOLBY_VISION stream group that mpv's demux/dovi_split
# and demux_lavf now rely on. release/8.1 has NEITHER, so master is required until
# an ffmpeg release ships them. The vendored dovi_split patch is gone (upstream).
FFMPEG_URL="https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg.git"
FFMPEG_REF="master"

# NB: the mpv base is no longer pinned. The old MPV_FEL_BASE pin existed only to
# keep the vendored FEL mpv patch (patches-fel/) from rotting against a moving
# master; that patch is deleted (mpv master has the feature), so the build now
# tracks mpv master HEAD via scripts/apply-patches-master.sh, exactly like the
# orender master-tracking flow.

# Remaining gate before this from-source dep stack can be dropped entirely (link
# distro/system libs instead): libplacebo AND ffmpeg must cut releases that carry
# the FEL API + dovi_split, AND distros must package them. Tracking:
#   mpv        : https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv/pull/17932            (MERGED, v0.42.0)
#   libplacebo : https://code.videolan.org/videolan/libplacebo/-/merge_requests/851  (merged to master)
#   ffmpeg     : dovi_split BSF + DoVi stream group                      (in FFmpeg master)
